From 948c6fe7cfa4b52e7cf2315914473bc765a8703c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Do <david.do@openkingdom.com>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 17:52:28 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 07/27] netgen: fix the COMPILE error from the 9-billion
 tokenomics change (b.Percent is gone)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Commit cf5a54b doi truong `Percent` -> `Nhom`/`NhomPct` nhung bo sot HAI cho
dung: allocation.go:182 va main.go:242. Ca goi netgen KHONG BIEN DICH DUOC.
`go build ./9chain-a1-tools/netgen` truoc ban va:
  allocation.go:182:16: bk.Percent undefined (type bucket has no field or method Percent)

=> Buoc "gen-network.sh 9" cua ke hoach re-genesis se chet ngay dong dau,
truoc khi lam bat cu gi. May la `gen-network.sh` chay `go run` chu khong dung
binary co san, nen no HONG TO chu khong lang le sinh ra mang bang tokenomics cu.

Vi sao cong chan khong bat duoc: `scripts/check-consistency.mjs` khong doc mot
dong Go nao — no giu bang so rieng bang JS. 17 dat + 6/6 doi chung nguoc chung
minh cac CON SO David chot la nhat quan voi nhau, KHONG chung minh gi ve ma se
sinh ra genesis. Dung ho "phep kiem do sai dai luong".

Sua kem trong cung luot, deu la he qua cua cf5a54b:
- allocation.md con in "Tran cung: 720,000,000 LOVE9" (hang so chet trong chuoi).
  Nay la hang `supplyCapLOVE9`, co chu thich noi ro day la ban CHEP TAY thu hai
  cua SupplyCap va check-consistency.mjs giu ban thu ba.
- Bang trong allocation.md: header 10 cot, dong du lieu 9 (thieu cot Hang muc).
  Markdown van render nen khong ai thay — nhan lech mot cot.
- keys.txt in "<Ten> — 12%" cho ca Foundation lan self-bond (hai dia chi cung
  mot hang muc) => cong don ra 111%. Nay in "hang muc Foundation (12%)".
- Chu thich main.go noi avalanchego "BO QUA allocation thuong" cua quy self-bond.
  Chi vong P-Chain bo qua (genesis.go:358); vong X-Chain khong bo qua ai.

Nghiem thu: `go build ./9chain-a1-tools/netgen` sach trong golang:1.25.10-bookworm,
va chay that N=9 ra thu muc nhap: tong phat hanh 5,400,000,000 LOVE9, bang phan bo
khop D-042 tung dong (12/30/9/9 + self-bond 8,999,991 = 9 x 999,999).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 9chain-a1-tools/netgen/allocation.go | 19 +++++++++++++++----
 9chain-a1-tools/netgen/main.go       | 26 ++++++++++++++++----------
 2 files changed, 31 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

diff --git a/9chain-a1-tools/netgen/allocation.go b/9chain-a1-tools/netgen/allocation.go
